      "title": "Upcoming games",
      "description": "Live from statsapi.mlb.com, filtered by the dashboard time range.\n\nBrewers games carry on **channel 121 (Milwaukee Brewers HD)** \u2014 an MLB.TV team feed, verified carrying a live game on 2026-08-04.\n\nCaveat: 'Broadcast' is whichever feed MLB lists first, which for away games is often the opponent's regional network rather than the Brewers feed. Treat it as 'a broadcaster', not 'your broadcaster'.",
      "id": 1,
